flowchart LR
    subgraph build [Build stage]
        commit[Commit pushed] --> compile[Compile] --> unit[Unit tests]
    end
    subgraph release [Release stage]
        tag[Tag release] --> sign[Sign artifacts] --> publish[Publish to registry]
    end
    unit -->|green| tag
    unit -->|red| alert[Alert the author]
    publish --> announce[Post release notes]
